# A guest carries a rock across the room, and the host recalls it from her hands: she lets go and
# walks on, nothing is left stuck, and the rock is home for everyone. Her hands are free after: she
# takes the other rock.
scenario recall_carry
scene glass_door
seed 5
guests 1
settle 6s

net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms loss 2% reorder 10% reorder_delay 40ms

p1 grab rock_a as lift
p1 wait 300ms
p1 walk -2 2 speed 2 as carry
at 1s p0 recall rock_a as recall
p1 walk rock_b
p1 grab rock_b as other
p1 wait 300ms
p1 drop as put

expect result lift granted
expect result recall done
expect result carry done
expect result other granted
expect result put done
# She carried it moving when the host took it: her states of it reached the host late, dropped.
expect late_drops.count >= 1
# What she sent of the rock under her old number until she heard: about a state a tick over the
# move's trip to her, a lost record's resend and her release.
expect late_drops.count <= 30
expect moved rock_a <= 1cm
expect agree_at_rest 5cm 5deg
expect no_stuck
expect effects_once
